  "description": "Use of one room of existing dwelling (Class C3) as an ancillary office space for taxi hire.\r\rThe property will continue to be used primarily as a single private residential dwelling. The business activity will be limited to administrative functions only, including receiving and managing bookings via telephone and email.\r\rNo members of the public will attend the premises. There will be no physical signage, no external alterations, and no change to the residential appearance of the property.\r\rNo staff will be employed at the premises. The business will be operated solely by the applicant.\r\rNo machinery or equipment will be installed other than standard home office equipment (computer and telephone).\r\rThe use will not generate any additional traffic, noise, or disturbance to neighbours. All bookings will be managed remotely.\r\rThe administrative activity may take place at flexible hours, depending on booking requirements, but without any impact on the residential character of the property.",
